{"ref":"BDB, לַח²","hw":"לַח²","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">לַח</span></big>  <strong>adj. moist, fresh, new</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">ל׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:37\" href=\"/Genesis.30.37\">Gn 30:37</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 21:3\" href=\"/Ezekiel.21.3\">Ez 21:3</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">לָ֑ח</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 17:24\" href=\"/Ezekiel.17.24\">17:24</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">לַחִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 6:3\" href=\"/Numbers.6.3\">Nu 6:3</a> + 2 times;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>moist, fresh</em>, of trees, fruit, etc.; <span dir=\"rtl\">לִבְנֶה לַה</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:37\" href=\"/Genesis.30.37\">Gn 30:37</a> (J); <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵץ ל׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 17:24\" href=\"/Ezekiel.17.24\">Ez 17:24</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 21:3\" href=\"/Ezekiel.21.3\">21:3</a>; grapes <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲנָבִים ל׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 6:3\" href=\"/Numbers.6.3\">Nu 6:3</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>new</em>, of cords, <span dir=\"rtl\">יְתָרִים ל׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 16:7\" href=\"/Judges.16.7\">Ju 16:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 16:8\" href=\"/Judges.16.8\">8</a>, prob. made of <em>fresh</em> sinews of animal (cf. Syriac <span dir=\"rtl\">ܝܺܬܰܪ</span> PS <sup>1652</sup>; GFM<sup>ad loc.</sup>)","next":"BDB, לֵחַ","prev":"BDB, לחח"}